        "documentsRequired_md": "**General Document:**\n\n- Family Identity Card (Parivar Pehchan Patra).\n- Agreement 1 (agreement deed between the beneficiary and the fisheries Department).\n- Date of Birth Certificate (Voting Card/Birth Certificate/Aadhar Card/Matriculation Certificate).\n- Caste Certificate (from a first-class Magistrate (Tehsildar)).\n- Training Certificate.\n- Land Record (Land record from Tehsil (own land- Jamabandi, Nakal, Akshizra, Farad) or registered lease deed of minimum 7 years.\n- Bills/Receipts/Vouchers.\n- Photographs of cages with beneficiary.\n- Bank Account Detail.\n- Pan Card.\n\n**Detailed Project Report (DPR)/Self-Contained Proposal (SCP) with:**\n\n- Project justification.\n- Capital and recurring cost details.\n- Source of the beneficiary&#39;s contribution.\n- Bank consent for loan (if applicable).\n- Employment potential and project timeline.\n- An undertaking that no other government assistance has been availed for the project.\n\n<br>\n\n",
